WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.884
This is my portfolio.

2
00:00:01.884 --> 00:00:06.727
I built it with Claude Code as a pair, the way I build client work.

3
00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:09.076
The work comes first:

4
00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:13.061
four case studies, each with the decisions, the tradeoffs,

5
00:00:13.061 --> 00:00:16.153
what went wrong, and a diagram of the system.

6
00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:20.287
The writing is five real production problems,

7
00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:24.939
and each one says plainly what was mine and what an AI agent did.

8
00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:29.386
The Lab runs live three.js code, not video.

9
00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:35.169
On the home page, phones and reduced motion get a still image instead.

10
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:39.557
Every release runs checks in real Chrome:

11
00:00:39.557 --> 00:00:45.177
every page, six screen widths, no console errors, no broken links.

12
00:00:45.177 --> 00:00:47.731
Lighthouse runs on every push.

13
00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:52.546
No cookies, no trackers, six security headers,

14
00:00:52.546 --> 00:00:55.353
and the code is public on GitHub.

